{"seq":1,"slug":"interpretation-models","title":"解释执行模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/interpreters-vms/foundations/interpretation-models","wordCount":1735,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"解释执行模型\">解释执行模型</h1><p>同一段源代码，CPython 把它读进内存后逐节点求值，V8 先把它编成字节码再交给寄存器机器跑，而 LuaJIT 在跑热了之后干脆把它翻成原生指令。三者都&quot;解释&quot;了这段代码，却落在一条从纯解释到纯编译的连续光谱上的不同位置。理解这条光谱，是理解整个 hub 后续每一篇的前提：树遍历、字节码 VM、栈式与寄存器式机器、垃圾回收、JIT，全都是这条光谱上某个权衡点的具体工程化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>解释执行的本质是：用一个已经存在的程序（解释器）去驱动另一段程序（用户代码）的语义，而不把用户代码先彻底降级成目标机器的指令集。它与编译执行的区别不在&quot;有没有翻译&quot;，而在&quot;翻译发生的时机&quot;以及&quot;翻译产物的抽象层级&quot;。把这两个维度铺开，就得到了一个可以安放所有实现策略的坐标系。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  SRC[源代码] --&gt; LEX[词法语法分析]&#10;  LEX --&gt; AST[抽象语法树]&#10;  AST --&gt;|直接求值| TW[树遍历解释器]&#10;  AST --&gt;|降级| BC[字节码]&#10;  BC --&gt;|逐条分派| VM[字节码虚拟机]&#10;  BC --&gt;|热路径再编译| JIT[JIT 原生码]&#10;  TW --&gt; OUT[程序行为]&#10;  VM --&gt; OUT&#10;  JIT --&gt; OUT\">flowchart TD\n  SRC[源代码] --&gt; LEX[词法语法分析]\n  LEX --&gt; AST[抽象语法树]\n  AST --&gt;|直接求值| TW[树遍历解释器]\n  AST --&gt;|降级| BC[字节码]\n  BC --&gt;|逐条分派| VM[字节码虚拟机]\n  BC --&gt;|热路径再编译| JIT[JIT 原生码]\n  TW --&gt; OUT[程序行为]\n  VM --&gt; OUT\n  JIT --&gt; OUT</pre><p>一段代码可能在生命周期内同时经历多条路径：一个函数第一次被调用走解释路径，调用上千次后被 JIT 编成原生码——这正是 <a href=\"../jit/jit-principles\">JIT 编译原理</a> 与 <a href=\"../jit/tiered-deopt\">分层编译与去优化</a> 要展开的主题。本篇只负责把坐标系建立起来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四种执行策略的光谱\">四种执行策略的光谱</h2><p>把执行策略按&quot;启动延迟&quot;和&quot;峰值吞吐&quot;两个维度排开，会看到一条清晰的取舍曲线。越靠近纯解释，越省去编译时间、内存占用低、可移植性好；越靠近纯编译，运行越快但前期投入越大、对动态语言越不友好。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>翻译时机</th>\n<th>产物抽象层级</th>\n<th>启动延迟</th>\n<th>峰值吞吐</th>\n<th>典型代表</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>树遍历解释</td>\n<td>不预翻译</td>\n<td>AST 节点</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>Ruby MRI 1.8、早期 PHP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字节码解释</td>\n<td>加载时一次</td>\n<td>紧凑字节码</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>CPython、Lua</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JIT 编译</td>\n<td>运行时按热度</td>\n<td>原生机器码</td>\n<td>中（编译开销）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>V8、HotSpot、LuaJIT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AOT 编译</td>\n<td>构建期一次</td>\n<td>原生机器码</td>\n<td>最低（已是机器码）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>C/C++、GraalVM Native Image</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>值得注意的是，这条光谱不是单调的&quot;越右越好&quot;。AOT 失去了运行时类型反馈，对 JavaScript 这类高度动态的语言反而可能跑不过 JIT；纯解释器在脚本只跑一次的场景（构建脚本、CLI 工具）下，省掉的编译时间往往比省下的执行时间更值钱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"抽象机器与求值语义\">抽象机器与求值语义</h2><p>无论落在光谱哪一点，解释器都在实现一台&quot;抽象机器&quot;：它定义了一组状态（栈、寄存器、堆、程序计数器）和一组状态转移规则。树遍历解释器的抽象机器状态隐含在递归调用栈和环境链里；字节码 VM 的抽象机器状态则被显式物化成数据结构——这是 <a href=\"../vm-design/runtime-data-structures\">运行时数据结构</a> 要细讲的。</p>\n<p>形式化地说，一个解释器实现了一个求值关系 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo>⇓</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>v</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\langle e, \\sigma \\rangle \\Downarrow \\langle v, \\sigma&#x27; \\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇓</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0019em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span>：在环境与堆状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 下对表达式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 求值，得到结果值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 和新状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>σ</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。大步语义（big-step）一次性给出最终值，对应树遍历的递归求值；小步语义（small-step）描述每一步状态转移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo>→</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\langle e, \\sigma \\rangle \\to \\langle e&#x27;, \\sigma&#x27; \\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0019em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span>，对应字节码 VM 逐条指令推进程序计数器的方式。这个差别不是学究式的：它直接决定了你能否在求值中途挂起并恢复，也就决定了协程、生成器、可中断异常这些特性的实现难度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"性能直觉-开销在哪里\">性能直觉：开销在哪里</h2><p>解释器慢，慢在哪里？把一条加法 <code>a + b</code> 的执行拆开看：解释器要先取指（读出&quot;加法&quot;这个操作的标识）、再分派（跳到对应的处理逻辑）、再解码操作数、再做类型检查、最后才真正执行加法。原生码里这条加法可能就是一条 <code>add</code> 指令，而解释器为它付出了取指、分派、解码的固定税。</p>\n<p>衡量这笔税的常用指标是&quot;分派开销占比&quot;。在一个朴素的 switch 分派字节码 VM 里，每条字节码的取指与分派可能消耗 5 到 10 个时钟周期，而很多字节码本身的&quot;有效工作&quot;也就几个周期——也就是说一半以上的时间花在解释器的管理开销上。这正是 <a href=\"../vm-design/instruction-dispatch\">指令分派技术</a> 要攻克的核心矛盾，也是 JIT 存在的根本理由：把这笔重复缴纳的固定税，一次性消解掉。</p>\n<p>KaTeX 表达这层关系很直观：若每条指令的有效工作周期为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span>、分派开销为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>，则解释器相对原生码的减速比约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mi>w</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{w + d}{w}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2251em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d \\approx w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 时减速约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≫</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d \\gg w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span>（如大量简单指令）时减速可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"动态语言为什么偏爱解释器与-jit\">动态语言为什么偏爱解释器与 JIT</h2><p>Python、JavaScript、Ruby 这类语言把类型决策推迟到运行时：<code>a + b</code> 在不同调用点可能是整数相加、字符串拼接或用户自定义的 <code>__add__</code>。AOT 编译器在编译期看不到这些信息，只能生成保守的、处处带类型分发的代码。而解释器天然在运行时持有真实类型，JIT 更能据此把&quot;这个加法点 99% 是整数加法&quot;这条观察固化进特化代码——这就是 <a href=\"../jit/inline-cache-feedback\">内联缓存与类型反馈</a> 的立足点。</p>\n<p>2026 年的现实是连&quot;以解释为本&quot;的语言也在补 JIT：CPython 在 3.14 中把基于 copy-and-patch 技术的 tier 2 JIT 从实验特性转正为默认代码路径，pyperformance 基准上相对 3.13 取得约 12%–18% 的中位提升（见 <a href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.13.html\">CPython 3.14 JIT 文档</a> 与社区基准）。这印证了光谱不是非此即彼，而是同一运行时在不同热度下动态游走的多个点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>解释与编译的真正分界是&quot;翻译时机&quot;和&quot;产物抽象层级&quot;，而非有没有翻译。</li>\n<li>四种策略（树遍历、字节码、JIT、AOT）构成一条启动延迟与峰值吞吐相互取舍的光谱，没有普适最优。</li>\n<li>每个解释器都在实现一台抽象机器，其状态可隐式（递归栈）也可显式（字节码 VM 的运行时结构）。</li>\n<li>解释器的核心开销是取指、分派、解码这笔每条指令重复缴纳的固定税，减速比近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mi>w</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{w+d}{w}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2251em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>动态语言把类型决策推迟到运行时，使解释器与 JIT 成为天然搭配；2026 年连 CPython 都把 JIT 转正，光谱上的点是动态游走的。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一篇 <a href=\"tree-walking\">树遍历解释器</a> 进入光谱最左端，看最朴素的求值是怎么做的，以及它为什么终究要让位给字节码。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"解释执行模型","id":"解释执行模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"四种执行策略的光谱","id":"四种执行策略的光谱"},{"level":2,"text":"抽象机器与求值语义","id":"抽象机器与求值语义"},{"level":2,"text":"性能直觉：开销在哪里","id":"性能直觉-开销在哪里"},{"level":2,"text":"动态语言为什么偏爱解释器与 JIT","id":"动态语言为什么偏爱解释器与-jit"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"树遍历解释器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/interpreters-vms/foundations/tree-walking"}}